      {
        "id": 19404,
        "name": "Belle Sorciere",
        "username": "Belle_Sorciere",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/belle_sorciere/{size}/1982_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-09-03T21:35:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Last night I tried to log into my store account, wasn't able to, created a new account, and ordered the Spirit Island promo pack.</p>\n<p>Tried to log in today with the same credentials, couldn't log in. So I tried to send a password reset to my account, which got the response that no such account exists.</p>\n<p>I've been receiving e-mail from GTG at this address for quite some time now, so it's pretty strange that accounts just vanish overnight. And my forum account that obviously still exists. And I received two \"back in stock\" notifications from the store on March 19, 2019.</p>\n<p>I'm not super concerned about not getting my order - I assume I will - I'm just concerned that store accounts don't seem to \"stick\" anymore. And I want to make sure that I do get a tracking number when my order ships.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:04.531Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
