        "cooked": "<p>Also adding that my forum account does have an order recorded for December 4, 2015, for the Sentinels holiday promos (Santa Guise and I think Termi-Nation stuff? Not 100% positive). It does not, however, list the order I made last night.</p>\n<p>Edit: I can see my order invoice by requesting an access link, so that's not in limbo. Just concerning about the account stuff.</p>",
