        "created_at": "2019-09-04T17:00:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello Belle Sorciere!</p>\n<p>I responded to your email, but I wanted to follow up here as well. I found your new account in our webstore and registered it, so you should receive an additional email from us with a temporary password. I'm sorry for the inconvienence; we are working on improving our webstore to help minimize these issuews, but please let me know if there is anything I can assist with!</p>\n<p>Katie</p>",
